Atlas Notes helps researchers keep locations, observations, and references in
one readable workspace. The interface treats the map as context rather than a
dashboard that competes with the notes.

= From fieldwork to synthesis

The prototype follows a note from its first capture through tagging, source
review, and a final collection that can be shared with a wider team.
